{"v":4,"catch":"和平的終極武器。 戰鬥準備工作已經完成。\n我們不會退縮。","desc":"《METAL BLACK》是TAITO於1991年發行的一款射擊遊戲。\n設置在星際入侵者手中瀕臨毀滅的世界，玩家控制秘密戰鬥機 BLACK FLY 並與敵人作戰。\n為能源 NEWALONE 與你的敵人戰鬥，並用它來充能強大的光束武器來摧毀你的敵人！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-11-17","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/62a5b90e9af11d69ca13c60caaf14330c98deb3fbf18c9c91ab680d05915b6df.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c1ad05633fcb51889bf38c2cd99edaa0ab367c94cee67b4f7c30a2f716b9f118.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ae4926977ed356796f51d63a4fc5a83ace91e2690b42d88a85f29e1bbefe08f0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9b8cc75ca0dd0560fe0f6674f7436e0a509c4541b164c91613d8b0a84b2ceb6a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e52457c1f714a2fddfd762e526c742c7606efa0c39587add34a6fd5b1ffb15b5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/46d8951acc162de0fb3a4a9d157ab0a330b951bbeca7b4bed9c4fde32b9f3e54.jpg"],"titleId":"0100852018b96000","dlc":[]}